**What was fixed and why:**

| Bug | Root cause | Fix |
|-----|-----------|-----|
| Ghost charges | `charge` succeeded, then `decrement` failed (race or stock unavailable) → customer charged, no item | `reserve()` decrements atomically *before* payment; `release()` returns stock if payment fails |
| Overselling | `check_stock` → `decrement` had a race window between them | `reserve()` holds the lock for the full check-and-decrement under `async with self._lock` |

