- `inventory.py` — added `reserve()` and `release()` with an `asyncio.Lock()`
- `payments.py` — added `refund(order_id)` for the (now unused) reverse path; kept for correctness
- `checkout.py` — replaced `check_stock` + `decrement` with `reserve`; added `release` on payment failure
